OL,3,GNEWSARural crime costing #41m is 'tip
OL,4,Aof the iceberg'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRural crime costing tens of millions of
OL,7,Fpounds a year is just "the tip of the
OL,8,Ficeberg", an expert has warned.
OL,10,FData collated by insurers NFU Mutual
OL,11,Frevealed rural crime in the UK cost
OL,12,F#41.5m in 2025, but Dr Kreseda Smith -
OL,13,Fassociate professor in rural
OL,14,Fcriminology at Harper Adams University
OL,15,Fin Shropshire - said the figure did not
OL,16,Frepresent the full picture.
OL,18,F"We know from various research sources
OL,19,Fthat rural serious organised crime
OL,20,Fextends far beyond that particular
OL,21,Felement," she told MPs.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
